          "message": "ci(release): restore npm provenance/OIDC for verified badge\n\nReverts 63c265a. Operator wants OIDC KEPT ON so npm-provenance attaches\nand the package gets the 'verified' badge on the next release. PR #3 (drop\nOIDC) was merged before the clarification; this restores provenance:true +\nid-token:write on main.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>"
