        {
          "hash": "63c265a50081569797ccdd25524af062ef4d9b33",
          "subject": "ci(release): drop npm provenance/OIDC — publish via NPM_TOKEN only",
          "message": "ci(release): drop npm provenance/OIDC — publish via NPM_TOKEN only\n\nOperator decision: releases must NOT go through OIDC provenance. Trade-off\naccepted: no npm 'verified' provenance badge; no functional/install impact.\n\n- .releaserc.json: @semantic-release/npm provenance true -> false\n- release.yml: remove permissions.id-token (OIDC token no longer minted,\n  so npm CLI auto-provenance cannot trigger either)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>"
